   "end_sec": 20.522,
   "duration_sec": 12.278
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "二時から三時までです。港図書館です。港駅の近くにあります。駅の出口で会って、一緒に行きましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D003-S01",
    "C18-D003-S02",
    "C18-D003-S03",
    "C18-D003-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 20.872,
   "end_sec": 28.21,
   "duration_sec": 7.338
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "いいですね。私はその図書館を知りません。駅には何時に行きますか。パクさんも来ますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D004-S01",
    "C18-D004-S02",
    "C18-D004-S03",
    "C18-D004-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 28.56,
   "end_sec": 35.704,
   "duration_sec": 7.144
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "一時四十分に駅で会いましょう。パクさんにはまだ連絡していません。今から連絡します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D005-S01",
    "C18-D005-S02",
    "C18-D005-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 36.054,
   "end_sec": 41.396,
   "duration_sec": 5.342
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "パクさん、明日、図書館で日本語の会話を練習しませんか。二時から三時までです。リンさんも来ます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D006-S01",
    "C18-D006-S02",
    "C18-D006-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 41.746,
   "end_sec": 48.441,
   "duration_sec": 6.695
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "明日の午後はちょっと。仕事がありますから。午前中は時間があります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D007-S01",
    "C18-D007-S02",
    "C18-D007-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 48.791,
   "end_sec": 53.685,
   "duration_sec": 4.894
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "リンさんは午前中、勉強します。明日は二人で行きます。今度、一緒に行きましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D008-S01",
    "C18-D008-S02",
    "C18-D008-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 54.035,
   "end_sec": 60.08,
   "duration_sec": 6.045
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "はい、今度は一緒に行きたいです。明日の練習の後で、また連絡してください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D009-S01",
    "C18-D009-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 60.43,
   "end_sec": 65.001,
   "duration_sec": 4.571
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "こんにちは。港図書館の中村です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D010-S01",
    "C18-D010-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 65.901,
   "end_sec": 68.886,
   "duration_sec": 2.985
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "こんにちは。すみません、名前をもう一度、ゆっくりお願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D011-S01",
    "C18-D011-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 69.236,
   "end_sec": 74.449,
   "duration_sec": 5.213
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "な・か・む・らです。図書館の受付にいます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D012-S01",
    "C18-D012-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 74.799,
   "end_sec": 79.068,
   "duration_sec": 4.269
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "中村さんですね。私はマテオです。明日、友達と二人で行きます。二時から教室を使ってもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D013-S01",
    "C18-D013-S02",
    "C18-D013-S03",
    "C18-D013-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 79.418,
   "end_sec": 87.295,
   "duration_sec": 7.877
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい。明日の教室の予定は二時から三時までですね。入口の右に受付があります。教室は受付の隣です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D014-S01",
    "C18-D014-S02",
    "C18-D014-S03",
    "C18-D014-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 87.645,
   "end_sec": 97.311,
   "duration_sec": 9.666
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい、三時までです。受付で何をしますか。名前を紙に書きますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D015-S01",
    "C18-D015-S02",
    "C18-D015-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 97.661,
   "end_sec": 103.454,
   "duration_sec": 5.793
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい。机の上に紙とペンがあります。名前を書いて、教室に入ってください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D016-S01",
    "C18-D016-S02",
    "C18-D016-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 103.804,
   "end_sec": 109.815,
   "duration_sec": 6.011
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。教室でパンを食べてもいいですか。友達とパンを買います。水も買います。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D017-S01",
    "C18-D017-S02",
    "C18-D017-S03",
    "C18-D017-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 110.165,
   "end_sec": 116.732,
   "duration_sec": 6.567
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "教室でパンを食べてはいけません。水は飲んでもいいです。図書館の隣に公園があります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D018-S01",
    "C18-D018-S02",
    "C18-D018-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 117.082,
   "end_sec": 123.804,
   "duration_sec": 6.722
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "では、集まりの後で、公園で食べます。水は教室で飲みます。ありがとうございます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D019-S01",
    "C18-D019-S02",
    "C18-D019-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 124.154,
   "end_sec": 130.438,
   "duration_sec": 6.284
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D020",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい。明日は図書館の入口の地図も見てください。公園と駅もその地図にあります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D020-S01",
    "C18-D020-S02",
    "C18-D020-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 130.788,
   "end_sec": 137.789,
   "duration_sec": 7.001
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D021",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "リンさん、もう図書館に電話しました。教室は二時から三時までです。水は飲んでもいいです。教室ではパンを食べてはいけません。隣に公園があります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D021-S01",
    "C18-D021-S02",
    "C18-D021-S03",
    "C18-D021-S04",
    "C18-D021-S05"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 138.689,
   "end_sec": 149.613,
   "duration_sec": 10.924
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D022",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。パンは公園で食べましょう。準備を手伝いましょうか。今、時間があります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D022-S01",
    "C18-D022-S02",
    "C18-D022-S03",
    "C18-D022-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 149.963,
   "end_sec": 156.818,
   "duration_sec": 6.855
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D023",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "では、店のメニューを見てください。パンと水が欲しいです。買い物のお金は六百円あります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D023-S01",
    "C18-D023-S02",
    "C18-D023-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 157.168,
   "end_sec": 163.238,
   "duration_sec": 6.07
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D024",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "メニューはここにあります。パンは一つ二百円、水は一本百円です。パンはいくつ買いますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D024-S01",
    "C18-D024-S02",
    "C18-D024-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 163.588,
   "end_sec": 170.954,
   "duration_sec": 7.366
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D025",
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "二つ買います。パクさんは仕事がありますから、明日は来ません。水も二本買いましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D025-S01",
    "C18-D025-S02",
    "C18-D025-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 171.304,
   "end_sec": 176.752,
   "duration_sec": 5.448
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D026",
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "二人ですね。パンと水の値段は六百円です。もう買いましたか。私はまだ買っていません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D026-S01",
    "C18-D026-S02",
    "C18-D026-S03",
    "C18-D026-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 177.102,
   "end_sec": 183.889,
   "duration_sec": 6.787
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D027",
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "私もまだ買っていません。明日、図書館へ行く前に買いましょう。一時三十分に駅で会いませんか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D027-S01",
    "C18-D027-S02",
    "C18-D027-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 184.239,
   "end_sec": 191.097,
   "duration_sec": 6.858
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D028",
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "一時四十分ではありませんか。一時三十分ですか。どうしてですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D028-S01",
    "C18-D028-S02",
    "C18-D028-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "low_ASR_text_match"
   ],
   "start_sec": 191.447,
   "end_sec": 197.552,
   "duration_sec": 6.105
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D029",
   "turn_index": 28,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "理由は買い物です。図書館へ行く前に、駅の隣の店でパンと水を買いますから。一時三十分は大丈夫ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D029-S01",
    "C18-D029-S02",
    "C18-D029-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 197.902,
   "end_sec": 205.418,
   "duration_sec": 7.516
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D030",
   "turn_index": 29,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "一時三十分は大丈夫です。駅の出口で待ちます。パンを買った後で、一緒に地図を見ましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D030-S01",
    "C18-D030-S02",
    "C18-D030-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 205.768,
   "end_sec": 212.692,
   "duration_sec": 6.924
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D031",
   "turn_index": 30,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。まず買い物、それから図書館ですね。今から新しい時間と準備の順番をメッセージに書きます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D031-S01",
    "C18-D031-S02",
    "C18-D031-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 213.042,
   "end_sec": 220.204,
   "duration_sec": 7.162
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C18-D032",
   "turn_index": 31,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。明日は一時三十分ですね。私は今からノートとペンを準備します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C18-D032-S01",
    "C18-D032-S02",
    "C18-D032-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
