   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "明日は休みですから、大丈夫です。",
   "start_sec": 11.56,
   "end_sec": 13.784,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D002-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D002",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "午前中は家で勉強します。",
   "start_sec": 13.934,
   "end_sec": 16.453,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D002-S04",
   "unit_id": "C18-D002",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "集まりは何時からですか。",
   "start_sec": 16.603,
   "end_sec": 18.677,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D002-S05",
   "unit_id": "C18-D002",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "図書館はどこですか。",
   "start_sec": 18.827,
   "end_sec": 20.522,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D003-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D003",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "二時から三時までです。",
   "start_sec": 20.872,
   "end_sec": 22.359,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D003-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D003",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "港図書館です。",
   "start_sec": 22.509,
   "end_sec": 23.749,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D003-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D003",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "港駅の近くにあります。",
   "start_sec": 23.899,
   "end_sec": 25.837,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D003-S04",
   "unit_id": "C18-D003",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "駅の出口で会って、一緒に行きましょう。",
   "start_sec": 25.987,
   "end_sec": 28.21,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D004-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "いいですね。",
   "start_sec": 28.56,
   "end_sec": 29.845,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D004-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "私はその図書館を知りません。",
   "start_sec": 29.995,
   "end_sec": 32.302,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D004-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "駅には何時に行きますか。",
   "start_sec": 32.452,
   "end_sec": 34.239,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D004-S04",
   "unit_id": "C18-D004",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "パクさんも来ますか。",
   "start_sec": 34.389,
   "end_sec": 35.704,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D005-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D005",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "一時四十分に駅で会いましょう。",
   "start_sec": 36.054,
   "end_sec": 38.021,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D005-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D005",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "パクさんにはまだ連絡していません。",
   "start_sec": 38.171,
   "end_sec": 40.079,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D005-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D005",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "今から連絡します。",
   "start_sec": 40.229,
   "end_sec": 41.396,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D006-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D006",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "パクさん、明日、図書館で日本語の会話を練習しませんか。",
   "start_sec": 41.746,
   "end_sec": 45.649,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D006-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D006",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "二時から三時までです。",
   "start_sec": 45.799,
   "end_sec": 47.285,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D006-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D006",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "リンさんも来ます。",
   "start_sec": 47.435,
   "end_sec": 48.441,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D007-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D007",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "明日の午後はちょっと。",
   "start_sec": 48.791,
   "end_sec": 50.409,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D007-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D007",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "仕事がありますから。",
   "start_sec": 50.559,
   "end_sec": 51.855,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D007-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D007",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "午前中は時間があります。",
   "start_sec": 52.005,
   "end_sec": 53.685,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D008-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D008",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "リンさんは午前中、勉強します。",
   "start_sec": 54.035,
   "end_sec": 56.133,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D008-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D008",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "明日は二人で行きます。",
   "start_sec": 56.282,
   "end_sec": 58.1,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D008-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D008",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "今度、一緒に行きましょう。",
   "start_sec": 58.25,
   "end_sec": 60.08,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D009-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D009",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "はい、今度は一緒に行きたいです。",
   "start_sec": 60.43,
   "end_sec": 62.454,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D009-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D009",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "パク",
   "text": "明日の練習の後で、また連絡してください。",
   "start_sec": 62.604,
   "end_sec": 65.001,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D010-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D010",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "こんにちは。",
   "start_sec": 65.901,
   "end_sec": 66.919,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D010-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D010",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "港図書館の中村です。",
   "start_sec": 67.069,
   "end_sec": 68.886,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D011-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D011",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "こんにちは。",
   "start_sec": 69.236,
   "end_sec": 70.146,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D011-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D011",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "すみません、名前をもう一度、ゆっくりお願いします。",
   "start_sec": 70.296,
   "end_sec": 74.449,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D012-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "な・か・む・らです。",
   "start_sec": 74.799,
   "end_sec": 77.341,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D012-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "図書館の受付にいます。",
   "start_sec": 77.491,
   "end_sec": 79.068,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D013-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "中村さんですね。",
   "start_sec": 79.418,
   "end_sec": 80.905,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D013-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "私はマテオです。",
   "start_sec": 81.055,
   "end_sec": 82.301,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D013-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "明日、友達と二人で行きます。",
   "start_sec": 82.451,
   "end_sec": 84.813,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D013-S04",
   "unit_id": "C18-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "二時から教室を使ってもいいですか。",
   "start_sec": 84.963,
   "end_sec": 87.295,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D014-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 87.645,
   "end_sec": 88.367,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D014-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "明日の教室の予定は二時から三時までですね。",
   "start_sec": 88.517,
   "end_sec": 92.583,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D014-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "入口の右に受付があります。",
   "start_sec": 92.733,
   "end_sec": 95.171,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D014-S04",
   "unit_id": "C18-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "教室は受付の隣です。",
   "start_sec": 95.321,
   "end_sec": 97.311,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D015-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "はい、三時までです。",
   "start_sec": 97.661,
   "end_sec": 99.451,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D015-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "受付で何をしますか。",
   "start_sec": 99.601,
   "end_sec": 101.409,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D015-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "名前を紙に書きますか。",
   "start_sec": 101.559,
   "end_sec": 103.454,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D016-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 103.804,
   "end_sec": 104.381,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D016-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "机の上に紙とペンがあります。",
   "start_sec": 104.531,
   "end_sec": 107.093,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D016-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "名前を書いて、教室に入ってください。",
   "start_sec": 107.243,
   "end_sec": 109.815,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D017-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 110.165,
   "end_sec": 110.891,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D017-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "教室でパンを食べてもいいですか。",
   "start_sec": 111.041,
   "end_sec": 113.642,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D017-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "友達とパンを買います。",
   "start_sec": 113.792,
   "end_sec": 115.475,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D017-S04",
   "unit_id": "C18-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "水も買います。",
   "start_sec": 115.625,
   "end_sec": 116.732,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D018-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "教室でパンを食べてはいけません。",
   "start_sec": 117.082,
   "end_sec": 119.498,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D018-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "水は飲んでもいいです。",
   "start_sec": 119.648,
   "end_sec": 121.291,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D018-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "図書館の隣に公園があります。",
   "start_sec": 121.441,
   "end_sec": 123.804,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D019-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "では、集まりの後で、公園で食べます。",
   "start_sec": 124.154,
   "end_sec": 127.495,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D019-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "水は教室で飲みます。",
   "start_sec": 127.645,
   "end_sec": 129.242,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D019-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "ありがとうございます。",
   "start_sec": 129.392,
   "end_sec": 130.438,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D020-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 130.788,
   "end_sec": 131.671,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D020-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "明日は図書館の入口の地図も見てください。",
   "start_sec": 131.821,
   "end_sec": 135.261,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D020-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "公園と駅もその地図にあります。",
   "start_sec": 135.411,
   "end_sec": 137.789,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D021-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "リンさん、もう図書館に電話しました。",
   "start_sec": 138.689,
   "end_sec": 141.502,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D021-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "教室は二時から三時までです。",
   "start_sec": 141.652,
   "end_sec": 143.9,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D021-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "水は飲んでもいいです。",
   "start_sec": 144.05,
   "end_sec": 145.511,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D021-S04",
   "unit_id": "C18-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "教室ではパンを食べてはいけません。",
   "start_sec": 145.661,
   "end_sec": 147.726,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D021-S05",
   "unit_id": "C18-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "隣に公園があります。",
   "start_sec": 147.876,
   "end_sec": 149.613,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D022-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "ありがとうございます。",
   "start_sec": 149.963,
   "end_sec": 151.419,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D022-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "パンは公園で食べましょう。",
   "start_sec": 151.569,
   "end_sec": 153.456,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D022-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "準備を手伝いましょうか。",
   "start_sec": 153.606,
   "end_sec": 155.332,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D022-S04",
   "unit_id": "C18-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "今、時間があります。",
   "start_sec": 155.482,
   "end_sec": 156.818,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D023-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "では、店のメニューを見てください。",
   "start_sec": 157.168,
   "end_sec": 159.159,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D023-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "パンと水が欲しいです。",
   "start_sec": 159.309,
   "end_sec": 160.854,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D023-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "買い物のお金は六百円あります。",
   "start_sec": 161.004,
   "end_sec": 163.238,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D024-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "メニューはここにあります。",
   "start_sec": 163.588,
   "end_sec": 165.163,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D024-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "パンは一つ二百円、水は一本百円です。",
   "start_sec": 165.313,
   "end_sec": 169.054,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D024-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "パンはいくつ買いますか。",
   "start_sec": 169.204,
   "end_sec": 170.954,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D025-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D025",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "二つ買います。",
   "start_sec": 171.304,
   "end_sec": 172.31,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D025-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D025",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "パクさんは仕事がありますから、明日は来ません。",
   "start_sec": 172.46,
   "end_sec": 175.167,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D025-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D025",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "水も二本買いましょう。",
   "start_sec": 175.317,
   "end_sec": 176.752,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D026-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D026",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "二人ですね。",
   "start_sec": 177.102,
   "end_sec": 178.229,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D026-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D026",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "パンと水の値段は六百円です。",
   "start_sec": 178.379,
   "end_sec": 180.826,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D026-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D026",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "もう買いましたか。",
   "start_sec": 180.976,
   "end_sec": 182.194,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D026-S04",
   "unit_id": "C18-D026",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "私はまだ買っていません。",
   "start_sec": 182.344,
   "end_sec": 183.889,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D027-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D027",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "私もまだ買っていません。",
   "start_sec": 184.239,
   "end_sec": 185.892,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D027-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D027",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "明日、図書館へ行く前に買いましょう。",
   "start_sec": 186.042,
   "end_sec": 188.469,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D027-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D027",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "一時三十分に駅で会いませんか。",
   "start_sec": 188.619,
   "end_sec": 191.097,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D028-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D028",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "一時四十分ではありませんか。",
   "start_sec": 191.447,
   "end_sec": 193.993,
   "review_flags": [
    "low_ASR_text_match",
    "clip_asr_difference"
   ],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D028-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D028",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "一時三十分ですか。",
   "start_sec": 194.143,
   "end_sec": 195.962,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D028-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D028",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "どうしてですか。",
   "start_sec": 196.112,
   "end_sec": 197.552,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D029-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D029",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "理由は買い物です。",
   "start_sec": 197.902,
   "end_sec": 199.31,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D029-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D029",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "図書館へ行く前に、駅の隣の店でパンと水を買いますから。",
   "start_sec": 199.46,
   "end_sec": 203.324,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D029-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D029",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "一時三十分は大丈夫ですか。",
   "start_sec": 203.474,
   "end_sec": 205.418,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D030-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D030",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "一時三十分は大丈夫です。",
   "start_sec": 205.768,
   "end_sec": 207.805,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D030-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D030",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "駅の出口で待ちます。",
   "start_sec": 207.955,
   "end_sec": 209.772,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D030-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D030",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "パンを買った後で、一緒に地図を見ましょう。",
   "start_sec": 209.922,
   "end_sec": 212.692,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D031-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D031",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 213.042,
   "end_sec": 213.51,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D031-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D031",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "まず買い物、それから図書館ですね。",
   "start_sec": 213.66,
   "end_sec": 216.456,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D031-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D031",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "今から新しい時間と準備の順番をメッセージに書きます。",
   "start_sec": 216.606,
   "end_sec": 220.204,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D032-S01",
   "unit_id": "C18-D032",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "ありがとうございます。",
   "start_sec": 220.554,
   "end_sec": 221.956,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D032-S02",
   "unit_id": "C18-D032",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "明日は一時三十分ですね。",
   "start_sec": 222.106,
   "end_sec": 224.854,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C18-D032-S03",
   "unit_id": "C18-D032",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "私は今からノートとペンを準備します。",
   "start_sec": 225.004,
   "end_sec": 228.026,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  }
 ]
}
